.TH SDL_GetJoystickSensorDataRate 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetJoystickSensorDataRate \- Get the data rate (number of events per second) of a joystick sensor.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_joystick.h>
.PP
.BI "float SDL_GetJoystickSensorDataRate(SDL_Joystick *joystick, SDL_SensorType type);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I joystick
the joystick to query\[char46]
.TP
.I type
the type of sensor to query\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the data rate, or 0\[char46]0f if the data rate is not available\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

